        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>4 Inch Aluminum Kickdown Door Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4 Inch Kickdown Door Stop mounts to the lower surface of the door to keep it in an open position. When not in use, it flips up and out of the way. This kickdown door holder is made of cast aluminum by Don-Jo, It includes a non-skid easily replaceable rubber tip to protect the floor and is supplied with mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1455_size.gif?v=1704354600\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1455 Kickdown Door Holder Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the 1455 Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Length: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Arm Thickness: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Tip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Plate Overall Height: 1.820\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/products/replacement-rubber-tip-for-kickdown-door-holder-don-jo-1468\"><b>Rubber Tip</b></a>: Gray</li>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #8 x 1\" Sheet Metal Screws</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b> or <b>Dark Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1455.pdf?v=1704262303\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1455 Kickdown Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
